# Large run artifacts: the raw 126MB index JSONs stay local; their verified
# gzip copies are tracked instead (GitHub blocks non-LFS files over 100MB).
# gunzip -k arm_*_index.json.gz to restore byte-identical originals.
archive/**/arm_*_index.json
# run.log files are part of the shared results (per-epoch tables, recon values)
!archive/**/*.log

